Package: zpicotls
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libbrotli-dev, libssl-dev
Description: TLS library with minicrypto and OpenSSL backends
 zpicotls is a TLS protocol library. This package contains the shared
 libraries, public headers, and pkg-config files for the core library and
 its minicrypto and OpenSSL backends. On supported CPUs it also includes
 the fusion backend.
